      "failure_mode": "Local Syntactic Severing in Heavy Hitter Selection",
      "mechanism": "Heavy-hitter pruners (H2O, SnapKV) sort keys strictly by cumulative attention sum. Function words (determiners, prepositions, punctuation) often have low individual attention sums but are structurally mandatory for grammatical binding. Evicting them causes immediate perplexity blowup (+1.72 delta).",
      "stratakv_resolution": "Tier-2 twistor dissolution uses curvature-aware superposition rather than naive sum-sorting. Syntactic connective tensors are preserved, holding perplexity degradation to a tiny +0.09."
    },
    {
      "failure_mode": "Prompt Anchor Amnesia in Sliding Windows",
      "mechanism": "Pure FIFO ring buffers discard the document opening once the window advances past 2,048 tokens. The model forgets the subject and narrative domain, resulting in a +3.46 perplexity penalty and hallucinations.",
      "stratakv_resolution": "Tier-1 pins the root semantic document anchors in on-die 48MB SLC indefinitely."
    },
    {
      "failure_mode": "Memory Explosion Wall in Full Attention",
